  "query": "-- 用户名片批量取（列表页一次取全，禁止 N+1）。$1 ids\nSELECT u.id AS \"id!\", u.username, coalesce(l.level, 1::smallint) AS \"level!\"\nFROM users u\nLEFT JOIN user_levels l ON l.user_id = u.id\nWHERE u.id = ANY($1::bigint[])\n",
